{"product_id":"drama-at-silver-spires","title":"Drama at Silver Spires","description":"\u003cp\u003eGeorgie loves acting and is desperate to win her dream role in the school play. But when she messes up at the audition, her smug rival gets the part instead. Disappointed but ever hopeful, Georgie secretly attends the play's rehearsals, but it's only a matter of time before she's discovered - and finds herself in trouble. Will she ever get the chance to show what she can really do? Filled with secrets, hopes, dreams and, above all, the power of friendship, \"School Friends\" is addictive reading for girls.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Ann Bryant\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780746072257\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 149\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45602588164249,"sku":"16RC-3-9780746072257","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68848be36ae6d_Drama_at_Silver_Spires_Ann_Bryant.jpg?v=1753711233","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/drama-at-silver-spires","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}